scope: "The DEFECT REGISTRY — a persistent, queryable home for fix-resistant-defect history so a fresh defect-investigator stops re-digging blind. It gives a recurring defect a stable identity, accumulates every fix attempt + why it didn't hold + the recurrence edges in a FactLattice GRAPH, and keeps the counts/aggregation in the retrospective SQLite. One graph<->SQLite seam; one defect-ops MCP (report/query/attempt/resolve); one roll-up publisher; one Dashboard widget."
